    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably go but i just cant today. i'm literally in the middle of something important and an urgent care visit is gonna take hours. i've dealt with cuts before and they always heal fine once i clean them. can you just tell me what i can use to disinfect it really well and what i should put on it to keep the dirt out while it closes up? like is there a specific ointment or something i can use to seal it?",
